      "statement": "Most uncensored recipes point at checkpoints with refusal directions removed in the weights, while the refusal-dial recipes (qwen38-27b-nvfp4-refusal-dial, deepseek-v4-flash-0731-refusal-dial-tp2, inkling-small-nvfp4-refusal-dial-tp2) serve stock weights and apply rank-1 refusal directions at inference time.",
